00:16:12,530 --> 00:16:13,710
What is that?

255
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:15,950
And what do you mean by direction?

256
00:16:16,450 --> 00:16:17,470
I'll explain.

257
00:16:17,930 --> 00:16:20,807
It's as famous as astrology
and tarot card reading,

258
00:16:20,890 --> 00:16:23,710
maybe more, but it's not fortune-telling.

259
00:16:24,190 --> 00:16:28,067
East Asian philosophy highlights the
idea that there are natural paths

260
00:16:28,150 --> 00:16:31,347
of energy in the natural world
such as the flow of wind and water.

261
00:16:31,430 --> 00:16:34,067
By knowing the direction
in which nature is flowing,

262
00:16:34,150 --> 00:16:37,268
it helps people choose
similar paths for their lives.

263
00:16:37,690 --> 00:16:38,749
Here's an example.

264
00:16:39,210 --> 00:16:43,567
Feng Shui is used to determine the good
and bad areas of the land, house, and room.

265
00:16:43,650 --> 00:16:46,127
If the direction of the
land or house is bad,

266
00:16:46,210 --> 00:16:48,647
it will affect the
resident's health, fortune,

267
00:16:48,730 --> 00:16:51,671
and even the whole family's
well-being negatively.

268
00:16:51,970 --> 00:16:56,207
In times of war, it is said that they
checked the Feng Shui of the castle,

269
00:16:56,290 --> 00:16:59,167
and thus could determine the
most advantageous area of the

270
00:16:59,250 --> 00:17:01,587
fortress they could attack
from to bring down the enemy.

271
00:17:01,670 --> 00:17:05,905
On the other hand, if you build a
shrine in the weak zone of the castle,

272
00:17:06,150 --> 00:17:07,870
and can calm the evil energy,

273
00:17:08,210 --> 00:17:11,445
the castle will gain a further
more solidified defense.

274
00:17:12,890 --> 00:17:17,730
And of course, this same theory of feng
shui can also be applied to human bodies.

275
00:17:18,090 --> 00:17:21,266
There's even an attack called
feng shui assassination.

276
00:17:21,810 --> 00:17:25,247
If you can control the direction
from which to attack your enemy,

277
00:17:25,330 --> 00:17:27,977
you're almost guaranteed
a victory over them.

278
00:17:28,670 --> 00:17:31,570
No matter how alert and
prepared the target is,

279
00:17:31,770 --> 00:17:34,187
you'll be able to approach
them without being noticed,

280
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:38,407
leaving them completely vulnerable,
and you can easily assassinate them.

281
00:17:38,490 --> 00:17:39,790
That means...

282
00:17:40,630 --> 00:17:41,710
Unlucky direction.

283
00:17:42,450 --> 00:17:45,807
I think we've now established
the secret of Kenzo's stand.

284
00:17:45,890 --> 00:17:48,890
The unlucky course pointing
straight toward FF.

285
00:17:49,450 --> 00:17:51,667
That dragon stand is
pointing out the precise

286
00:17:51,750 --> 00:17:54,515
direction for Kenzo to
kill them fast and easy.

287
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:59,067
And at some point very soon, his attack
will merge with that floating dragon.

288
00:17:59,150 --> 00:18:01,856
I'm afraid FF's fate has
already been decided.

289
00:18:02,430 --> 00:18:04,030
I can't believe Kenzo.

290
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:08,327
He spent the last 40 years in prison
mastering the Feng Shui assassination.

291
00:18:08,410 --> 00:18:11,110
And that skill developed
as his stand power.

292
00:18:12,150 --> 00:18:13,110
Feng Shui!

293
00:18:13,350 --> 00:18:14,821
The direction to proceed!

294
00:18:15,610 --> 00:18:19,316
Then that means, when he was on
defense, that would explain it.

295
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:22,467
That's why not one of the
bullets hit the old man either.

296
00:18:22,550 --> 00:18:23,380
Unbelievable.

297
00:18:23,890 --> 00:18:26,467
You're saying the feng shui also protected

298
00:18:26,550 --> 00:18:29,079
him as well as helped
him try to kill them?

299
00:18:29,510 --> 00:18:30,370
Yes, I am.

300
00:18:30,710 --> 00:18:33,247
When he holds that dragon
stand in his hands,

301
00:18:33,330 --> 00:18:36,210
he reads which direction
is the best to take.

302
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:41,803
And while moving in that direction,
he simultaneously launches his attack.

303
00:18:42,290 --> 00:18:46,770
The dragon is trying to show the
direct line to kill again. FF, wait!

304
00:18:47,050 --> 00:18:50,087
Those glasses were deliberately
made to shoot right into your face!

305
00:18:50,170 --> 00:18:51,610
Hold the old man off!

306
00:18:51,950 --> 00:18:53,947
Don't let him get too
close to that dragon!

307
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:54,860
I know.

308
00:18:54,943 --> 00:18:56,727
It makes no fucking sense to me either.

309
00:18:56,810 --> 00:19:01,230
But seriously, whatever you do, you
can't allow him to touch it! Let's go.

310
00:19:02,010 --> 00:19:03,527
Nicely done, Drake's Dream.

311
00:19:03,610 --> 00:19:04,440
Thank you.

312
00:19:04,523 --> 00:19:07,727
They figured it out because you
had to go and flap your scaly jaws.

313
00:19:07,810 --> 00:19:09,398
Shut up, you rotting mummy!

314
00:19:09,590 --> 00:19:11,847
I'm not your henchman or your underling.

315
00:19:11,930 --> 00:19:15,165
The art of feng shui belongs
to everyone, not just you.

316
00:19:15,270 --> 00:19:18,741
But it's true that you can
utilize my power to the fullest.

317
00:19:20,110 --> 00:19:25,170
FF, next unlucky spot is here,
right above your left ear. Feel it?

318
00:19:25,330 --> 00:19:29,036
This direction has the utmost
critical emergency alert ringing.

319
00:19:29,510 --> 00:19:33,650
Your lucky color is yellow, and your
charm is a picture of a goldfish,

320
00:19:33,910 --> 00:19:34,851
if you have him.

321
00:19:34,970 --> 00:19:37,630
Hey, look, he's going
around behind you, FF!

322
00:19:40,710 --> 00:19:42,450
Time for a knife hand strike.

323
00:19:42,710 --> 00:19:46,063
I don't even need to touch
the dragon's direction for it.

324
00:19:49,690 --> 00:19:53,730
The movement of his defending
arm is also working as an attack.

325
00:19:53,950 --> 00:19:55,421
Must be Tai Chi training.

326
00:19:56,310 --> 00:19:57,310
How's your mouth?

327
00:19:57,570 --> 00:19:58,770
I got you now!

328
00:20:02,670 --> 00:20:03,550
Well, how?

329
00:20:03,890 --> 00:20:07,167
If your defense works as an attack,
then the reverse applies too.

330
00:20:07,250 --> 00:20:09,750
Turn about is fair play, old man. Hiya!

331
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:12,247
I've grown tired of this, you bitch.

332
00:20:12,330 --> 00:20:17,154
I guess now I need to utilize the dragon's
direction to finish you off completely.

333
00:20:22,690 --> 00:20:25,127
I forced your arm to
merge with the dragon.

334
00:20:25,210 --> 00:20:26,187
How do you like that?

335
00:20:26,270 --> 00:20:29,767
Just so you know, that's the same
move I employed in my attack before.

336
00:20:29,850 --> 00:20:33,085
You're about to get beaten
senses by your very own arm.

337
00:20:46,350 --> 00:20:47,727
Yes, that did just happen.

338
00:20:47,810 --> 00:20:50,787
and my stand attack has merged
with the course of your death.

339
00:20:50,870 --> 00:20:51,700
You asshole!

340
00:20:51,990 --> 00:20:53,607
What the hell was that nightmare?

341
00:20:53,690 --> 00:20:55,170
I lost my arm just then.

342
00:20:55,330 --> 00:20:56,627
Are you responsible for that?

343
00:20:56,710 --> 00:20:58,687
I told you there's an unlucky direction.

344
00:20:58,770 --> 00:20:59,930
I'm very sorry.

345
00:21:00,270 --> 00:21:02,867
That's caused by the
direction's certain power.

346
00:21:02,950 --> 00:21:05,067
I have no way of knowing
what's gonna happen.

347
00:21:05,150 --> 00:21:07,847
In the next moments, but
if I were you, young lady,

348
00:21:07,930 --> 00:21:10,067
I would try my best to
prevent or minimize?

349
00:21:10,150 --> 00:21:11,630
the inevitable damage.

350
00:21:38,950 --> 00:21:41,207
Ah, Beth, hurry up and get out of there!

351
00:21:41,290 --> 00:21:43,207
It's been destroyed by the meteor!

352
00:21:43,290 --> 00:21:45,310
The fan's gonna fall on you!

353
00:21:53,150 --> 00:21:53,980
Actually,

354
00:21:54,063 --> 00:21:55,947
what you have to worry
about is not the fan,

355
00:21:56,030 --> 00:21:59,324
it's the metal boomerang
heading I'm coming towards you!

356
00:22:10,230 --> 00:22:11,450
Stop! Stop!

357
00:22:26,610 --> 00:22:30,210
Although you think I cope

358
00:22:31,450 --> 00:22:35,207
My head is filled with hope

359
00:22:35,290 --> 00:22:40,207
Of some place

360
00:22:40,290 --> 00:22:43,790
other than here

361
00:22:46,550 --> 00:22:50,190
Although you think I smile

362
00:22:51,790 --> 00:22:55,270
Inside and all the while

363
00:22:57,050 --> 00:23:03,450
I'm wondering about my destiny?

364
00:23:05,990 --> 00:23:07,907
I'm thinking

365
00:23:07,990 --> 00:23:13,607
about all the

366
00:23:13,690 --> 00:23:18,467
things I'd like

367
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:24,490
to do in my life.

368
00:23:25,990 --> 00:23:29,370
I'm a dreamer.

369
00:23:29,870 --> 00:23:34,510
A distant dreamer.

370
00:23:36,370 --> 00:23:39,830
Dreaming far away.

371
00:23:41,790 --> 00:23:44,590
From today!

372
00:23:54,490 --> 00:23:55,320
Thank you.

373
00:24:30,610 --> 00:24:31,810
Thank you.
